  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nA game that will break your heart! A deeply emotional, story-driven adventure set in a stunningly crafted post-apocalyptic world. Play as Sara, torn from her family during a brutal conflict, and embark on a journey of hope, loss, and discovery.<p></p>\n<p><b>Sneak. Survive. Discover the truth.</b></p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li><b>A Fight for Survival</b> – Step into the shoes of Sara, separated from her family in a brutal conflict. To reunite with them, she must navigate the ruins of a shattered world, using stealth and puzzle-solving to evade enemy drones and a terrifying secret weapon that hunts her every move.\n</li><li><b>Cinematic Exploration</b> – This is a third person exploration game where you traverse haunting landscapes, decaying cities, and uncovering clues about your loved ones. Strange balloons hint at a deeper mystery, drawing you into a gripping journey of hope and resilience.\n</li><li><b>A Haunting Soundtrack</b> – A stirring, evocative score intensifies every moment, immersing you in a world forever changed by greed and destruction.\n</li></ul>\n",
